fixture door_dash_carries_through
doc docs/adr/0014 and BUILD.md s5 Dash: a dash through a door goes on in the room beyond, its frames counting on and its speed kept: 9 frames of 20 u, four of them in door_b
room test/door_a
spawn 1140 416
frames 14
input
  0 R dash
  1..13 R
end
expect
  at 3 room=test_door_a state=dash dash_frame=4 x=1220u
  at 4 event.room=1 room=test_door_b state=dash dash_frame=5 x=74u vx=20u
  at 8 state=dash dash_frame=9 x=154u
  at 9 state=ground
end
